== 1. zbase: the offset of each move
zb-m1000: rd:12 move 0x1000: d [1024] (one offset)
zb-m4000: rd:12 move 0x4000: d [4096] (one offset)
zb-m10000: rd:12 move 0x10000: d [16384] (one offset)
zb-mst: rd:12 move store base: d [0] (one offset)
zb-m800: rd:12 move 0x800: d [512] (one offset)
zb-m40: rd:12 move 0x40: d [16] (one offset)
zb-m4: rd:12 move 0x4: d [0] (one offset)
granules g (bytes, a power of two) with floor((0x1000 + m) / g) * g - 0x1000 = 4 d on every move: [8, 16, 32, 64]
== 2. zbits: stencil store layout and load order (bytes explained of 2048)
