zbs-c16: control 0x0016300e; drawn 1024; store linear64 / load depth 2048, store depth / load linear64 16, store depth / load depth 16, store linear64 / load linear64 8
zbs-c20: control 0x0007300e; drawn 1024; store depth / load depth 2048, store linear64 / load linear64 1024, store linear64 / load depth 16, store depth / load linear64 8
zbs-c12-16: control 0x0016200e; drawn 1024; store linear64 / load linear64 2048, store depth / load depth 1024, store depth / load linear64 16, store linear64 / load depth 8
