zbs-c16-20: control 0x0006300e; drawn 1024; store linear64 / load depth 2048, store depth / load linear64 16, store depth / load depth 16, store linear64 / load linear64 8
zbs-set: control 0xf8f7b00e; drawn 2048; store linear64 / load linear64 8, store linear64 / load depth 8, store depth / load linear64 8, store depth / load depth 8; every stored byte 0xff (the test read 0, stored inverted)
